{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/GraphDrawing\/documentation\/GraphDrawing","doc:\/\/GraphDrawing\/documentation\/GraphDrawing\/GraphProtocols","doc:\/\/GraphDrawing\/documentation\/GraphDrawing\/GraphProtocols\/Graph"]]},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/GraphDrawing\/documentation\/GraphDrawing\/GraphProtocols\/Graph\/forceAtlas2Layout(iterations:scalingRatio:gravity:strongGravity:linLog:dissuadeHubs:jitterTolerance:barnesHutTheta:weight:using:)"},"abstract":[{"text":"A force-directed drawing by ForceAtlas2, from positions drawn uniformly in [0, 1)² from","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"generator","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"forceAtlas2Layout","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"iterations","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Int","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si"},{"text":" = 100, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"scalingRatio","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Double","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sd"},{"text":" = 2, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"gravity","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Double","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sd"},{"text":" = 1, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"strongGravity","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Bool","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb"},{"text":" = false, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"linLog","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Bool","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb"},{"text":" = false, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"dissuadeHubs","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Bool","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb"},{"text":" = false, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"jitterTolerance","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Double","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sd"},{"text":" = 1, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"barnesHutTheta","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Double","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sd"},{"text":"? = nil, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"weight","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": (","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Edges","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/Graph\/Edges-swift.associatedtype","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P5EdgesQa"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Index","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sl5IndexQa"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Double","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sd"},{"text":" = { _ in 1 }, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"using","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"generator","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"inout","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"some","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"RandomNumberGenerator","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SG"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Drawing","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphDrawing\/documentation\/GraphDrawing\/Drawing","preciseIdentifier":"s:12GraphDrawing0B0V"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Vertex","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/Graph\/Vertex","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P6VertexQa"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"discussion","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Each vertex has mass m = 1 + its degree (self-loops ignored, parallel edges counted). Every","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"pair of vertices repels with force k_r · m_u · m_v \/ d, where k_r is ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"scalingRatio"},{"text":" and d","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"their distance (at least 0.01); every edge attracts its ends with force ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"weight"},{"text":" · d, or","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"weight"},{"text":" · log(1 + d) with ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"linLog"},{"text":"; with ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"dissuadeHubs"},{"text":" an edge’s attraction is divided by","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the mass of its first end (","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"endpointIndices(ofEdgeAt:).u"},{"text":") and multiplied by the mean mass.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Gravity pulls each vertex towards the origin with force ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"gravity"},{"text":" · m, or ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"gravity"},{"text":" · m · d","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(d its distance from the origin) with ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"strongGravity"},{"text":". Two vertices at the same point repel","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"as if 0.01 apart, along a direction fixed by their two ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"vertices"},{"text":" offsets.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Each step moves every vertex along its net force F scaled by s \/ (1 + √(s · swing)), where","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a vertex’s swing is m · ‖F − F′‖, F′ its force in the previous step, and the global speed s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"adapts as in the reference implementation: it starts at 1 and, with the speed efficiency","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and ","type":"text"},{"code":"jitterTolerance","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", follows the ratio of the total traction Σ m ‖F + F′‖ \/ 2 to the total","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"swing, rising by at most half each step. The run makes ","type":"text"},{"code":"iterations","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" steps. The drawing is in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"layout units, not rescaled. A directed graph is drawn through ","type":"text"},{"code":"undirectedView","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The start takes exactly 2n draws: x then y for each vertex in ","type":"text"},{"code":"vertices","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" order, each the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"top 53 bits of one ","type":"text"},{"code":"next()","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". The same generator state gives the same drawing; positions","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"are not stable across library versions.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Repulsion is exact by default: O(n²) per step. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"barnesHutTheta: θ"},{"type":"text","text":" approximates it with a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Barnes–Hut quadtree of the masses, O(n log n) per step: a square cell of side s whose"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"centre of mass is at distance D from the vertex, and which does not contain it, acts as one"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"body of the cell’s mass when s\/D < θ. θ = 1.2 suits graphs past a few thousand vertices."}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Jacomy, Venturini, Heymann and Bastian, “ForceAtlas2, a continuous graph layout algorithm","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"for handy network visualization designed for the Gephi software”, PLoS ONE 9(6), 2014.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"O(iterations · (n² + m)) time exactly, O(iterations · (n log n + m)) with Barnes–Hut; O(n + m)","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"memory.","type":"text"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":""},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"iterations ≥ 0"},{"type":"text","text":"; "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"scalingRatio"},{"type":"text","text":" is positive and finite; "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"gravity"},{"type":"text","text":" and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"jitterTolerance"},{"type":"text","text":" are finite and not negative; "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"barnesHutTheta"},{"type":"text","text":", when given, is finite and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"not negative; every weight is finite and not negative."}]}],"name":"Precondition","type":"aside","style":"note"}]}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/graphdrawing\/graphprotocols\/graph\/forceatlas2layout(iterations:scalingratio:gravity:stronggravity:linlog:dissuadehubs:jittertolerance:barneshuttheta:weight:using:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Instance Method","symbolKind":"method","modules":[{"relatedModules":["GraphProtocols"],"name":"GraphDrawing"}],"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"forceAtlas2Layout","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"iterations","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Int","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"scalingRatio","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Double","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sd"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"gravity","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"tex